{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Welcome to life, Orderlord 7788. Before you are dispatched, U.O.L.O. must determine if you are fit for duty. The following training course will serve as an educational exercise, as well as an assessment of your capabilities. Now get to work, soldier!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Last Patrol Demo, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a half-organic, half-synthetic law enforcer, freshly birthed from the evolution tanks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the ropes with Phyllis, your friendly dispatch agent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your first mutations, unlocking new brutal abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweat perps and discover secrets at the U.O.L.O. Headquarters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in frenetic top-down combat against  otherworldly abominations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014660/extras/f2d5855e3a0899b955cd486e34235f64.avif?t=1757613073\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014660?t=1757613073","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014660?t=1757613073","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014660/dce6b487e5ea598efdd58d206fe4a0d87f9f6158/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757613073","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014660/dce6b487e5ea598efdd58d206fe4a0d87f9f6158/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757613073","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Foe